error[sensitive-value] machines.web.environment.DEMO_SECRET  (isoloom.yml:10:20)
  `DEMO_SECRET` is sensitive and would show in `docker inspect`
  fix: `files: [{ path: <path>, input: DEMO_SECRET }]`, or `inputs: { DEMO_SECRET: { sensitive: false } }`
